    "body": "(https://www.ghacks.net/2018/05/23/why-you-should-always-use-youtubes-privacy-enhanced-mode/)\r\n\r\n### Motivation\r\n\r\nDue to GDPR Cookie law is necessary to remove analytical cookies that youtube iframe uses when you the iframe domain is not https://www.youtube-nocookie.com.\r\nThe solution could be implement an option to use the youtube iframe whit **nocookie domain** and others necessary params:\r\n_<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/CiXNIjGX1hY\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" allowfullscreen></iframe>_\r\n\r\ninstead of:\r\n_<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/CiXNIjGX1hY\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" allowfullscreen></iframe>_\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n",
